                        </div>
                        <p style="color: #666666; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.75; padding-right: 15px;">
                            A benchmark of luxury, tranquility, and world-class Indian hospitality. Experience handcrafted royal suites, opulent fine dining, and serene spa retreats.
                        </p>
                        <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; background: #fdf8f3; border: 1px solid #e8ddd3; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 50px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill" style="color: #B88E68; font-size: 0.7rem;"></i>
                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill" style="color: #B88E68; font-size: 0.7rem;"></i>
                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill" style="color: #B88E68; font-size: 0.7rem;"></i>
                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill" style="color: #B88E68; font-size: 0.7rem;"></i>
                            <i class="bi bi-star-fill" style="color: #B88E68; font-size: 0.7rem;"></i>
                            <span style="color: #442305; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; margin-left: 4px;">5-Star Luxury Hotel</span>
